#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0042A expect=noViolation domain=ADLBC
#note "ASTTM carries a declared format (8.) that is NOT a SAS time format. Pins the AD0042A / PMDA-AD0042 partition: AD0042A asks only whether a format is DECLARED, so any non-empty format silences it; reporting 8. as a non-time format is PMDA-AD0042's job."
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col ASTTM   type=Num format=8.
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | SYSBP | 13.5
